  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 220 °C (200 °C if your oven is a fan oven).",
    "Put the brinjal, baby marrow, peppers, onions and garlic on your largest roasting tray, or two trays, so they sit in one layer. Drizzle with the oil, sprinkle with the oregano, paprika, salt and pepper and toss until everything is coated.",
    "Roast for 25 minutes, until the brinjal is soft and the edges of the vegetables are browning.",
    "Toss the vegetables, scatter over the cherry tomatoes and chickpeas, and lay the halloumi slices on top.",
    "Roast for 15 minutes more, until the halloumi is golden at the edges and the tomatoes have started to burst. For more colour, switch to the grill for the last 2 to 3 minutes and watch it closely.",
    "Just before serving, toss the rocket with the lemon juice, oil and a pinch of salt.",
    "Serve straight from the tray with the salad alongside."
  ],
